export function machineHuntCannonStep(robot,distance,dt){robot.shotCd=(robot.shotCd??1)-dt;if(robot.shotCd<=0&&distance>52&&distance<190){robot.shotCd=110/60;return true}return false}
export function machineHuntAdvanceShot(shot,dt,cameraShift=0){shot.x+=shot.vx*dt;shot.y+=shot.vy*dt+cameraShift;shot.life-=dt;return shot.life>1e-9}
